WEBVTT

00:16.850 --> 00:18.850
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:18.890 --> 00:22.770
<i>Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
attained everything this world has to offer.</i>

00:23.140 --> 00:27.020
<i>The words he uttered just before his death
drove people to the seas.</i>

00:27.150 --> 00:30.610
My treasure? If you want it, you can have it!

00:30.650 --> 00:34.610
Find it!
I left everything this world has to offer there!

00:34.950 --> 00:39.240
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:39.620 --> 00:42.370
<i>The world has truly entered a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:43.830 --> 00:45.370
<i>However...</i>

00:53.970 --> 00:56.090
--I can't see!
--Don't push!

00:56.220 --> 00:58.260
Get them out of the way already!

01:01.600 --> 01:02.470
This is hell.

01:02.600 --> 01:03.850
--Damn!
--This is the worst!

01:03.980 --> 01:04.770
Enough with this.

01:04.890 --> 01:06.900
Annoying pirates...

01:07.270 --> 01:10.230
<i>Even in such times,
the majority of people...</i>

01:10.270 --> 01:14.110
<i>...do not aspire to be pirates
and do not pursue the One Piece.</i>

01:14.700 --> 01:17.030
<i>Just like them...</i>

01:24.160 --> 01:25.660
<i>"Dear Nami-</i>san<i>,</i>

01:25.710 --> 01:28.130
<i>You're a special pirate.</i>

01:28.170 --> 01:30.960
<i>The world today is dominated
by barbarians...</i>

01:31.000 --> 01:35.010
<i>...who rely on their Devil Fruit power
and brute strength.</i>

01:35.050 --> 01:38.720
<i>But you can outsmart them
with your wits and resourcefulness!</i>

01:38.760 --> 01:41.470
<i>Nami-</i>san<i>, you're my hope."</i>

01:41.600 --> 01:43.310
Hey! Go make this delivery!

01:43.430 --> 01:47.190
<i>"I hope you continue to have
wonderful adventures!"</i>

01:47.310 --> 01:48.190
Delivery!

01:48.310 --> 01:50.270
Hey! I told you to knock!

01:50.400 --> 01:54.320
Where are your glasses? You'll get hurt
if you're making deliveries without them!

01:54.440 --> 01:56.280
I can't go. I'm busy.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.240
What?

01:57.360 --> 02:00.370
I'm about to go on
the adventure of a lifetime!

02:01.030 --> 02:04.580
--Bye!
--Listen. People can't live alone.

02:04.620 --> 02:09.000
The brothers from the greengrocer's family
give their parents money, and even just got promoted!

02:09.120 --> 02:12.340
I told you that those bulls and I
are completely different!

02:12.460 --> 02:15.710
Yeah, very different!
They work hard and...

02:16.420 --> 02:19.970
I heard they even played a big part
in the Paramount War!

02:22.430 --> 02:23.890
I wanna quit this job.

02:24.010 --> 02:25.180
Should we withdraw?!

02:25.310 --> 02:27.980
--No need. Go around the back!
--Yes, sir!

02:31.100 --> 02:32.810
Big Bro!

02:32.860 --> 02:34.900
Is that some kind of tactic?

02:37.860 --> 02:40.740
That's why you're moving up the ladder
slower than I am.

02:41.320 --> 02:43.620
Be smarter!

02:54.460 --> 02:57.550
<i>Of course, it's Dracule Mihawk!</i>

02:57.590 --> 03:00.340
I got to see Hawkeye in person,
so I'm sure of it!

03:00.470 --> 03:01.930
It's Vista the Flower Blade.

03:02.050 --> 03:05.430
No! The world's strongest swordsman
is Roronoa Zoro!

03:05.560 --> 03:06.600
Roronoa?

03:06.720 --> 03:08.980
Isn't he already dead to begin with?

03:09.020 --> 03:09.730
Right?

03:09.850 --> 03:10.890
--He's alive!
--He's dead!

03:11.020 --> 03:12.150
He's alive!

03:12.270 --> 03:16.360
He's dead!
I read in the paper that he died!

03:16.480 --> 03:18.280
Hey! If you wanna read it, buy it!

03:18.400 --> 03:20.700
--Afro's here!
--Go away, Afro!

03:20.820 --> 03:22.110
Stupid brats!

03:23.320 --> 03:25.620
<i>A cyborg shipwright, Franky.</i>

03:25.990 --> 03:30.910
<i>We will dig into the truth behind
his sudden disappearance two years ago!</i>

03:31.040 --> 03:35.540
MONTHLY SHIPWRIGHT, SPECIAL ISSUE ON FRANKY
RENTAL YAGARA SHOP OWNER

03:31.580 --> 03:33.710
Franky? I don't know...

03:33.830 --> 03:35.540
Ask people at the shipyard.

03:35.670 --> 03:37.800
Ask Iceburg-<i>san</i> about that sort of thing!

03:35.670 --> 03:37.800
GALLEY-LA COMPANY
VICE PRESIDENT, PAULIE-SAN

03:37.920 --> 03:39.380
You need an appointment.

03:37.920 --> 03:39.380
ICEBURG'S PERSONAL SECRETARY
ALICE-SAN

03:40.510 --> 03:42.050
<i>We were at a dead end.</i>

03:40.760 --> 03:43.470
AT A DEAD END

03:42.090 --> 03:47.430
<i>But we got a stunning picture of Franky!</i>

03:43.510 --> 03:47.430
STUNNING TRUE IMAGE OF HIM

03:48.930 --> 03:49.890
<i>What the...</i>

03:50.890 --> 03:52.480
Who's gonna buy this crap?

03:52.600 --> 03:53.690
Yeah.

04:00.240 --> 04:03.740
<i>"By the way, Nami-</i>san<i>, I didn't miss it!</i>

04:03.780 --> 04:07.830
<i>Captain Luffy's message, 3D2Y,
in the newspaper!</i>

04:08.490 --> 04:12.660
<i>And I knew that this was a ploy
to deceive the Navy!</i>

04:13.250 --> 04:15.420
<i>The key is how many times
he rang the bell!</i>

04:15.460 --> 04:19.500
<i>The number references the spawning cycle of
sea cucumbers around Sabaody!</i>

04:19.550 --> 04:21.880
<i>And their spawning day is precisely today!</i>

04:21.920 --> 04:26.680
<i>The Straw Hats will be reunited
on the Sabaody Archipelago today!</i>

04:27.050 --> 04:32.730
<i>That's how I knew to wait for you at the port
to be able to deliver this letter to you!</i>

04:39.270 --> 04:42.990
This street should have been less crowded...

04:44.400 --> 04:46.320
Okay, let's switch to plan B!

04:49.740 --> 04:50.580
Sorr...

04:50.830 --> 04:53.160
M-My bones are gonna break...

04:53.290 --> 04:54.540
You need more calcium.

04:54.660 --> 04:58.040
All you can do is pound milk more
because it's a matter of bones!

04:58.170 --> 05:00.550
Is that a skull joke? What a skull joke!

05:00.670 --> 05:02.300
What's wrong with them?!

05:03.630 --> 05:06.640
--Sorry that I'm a good-for-nothing.
--Sorry that I have a room full of merch.

05:06.760 --> 05:08.350
--Oh, shut up!
--Sorry that I keep buying the same merch.

05:08.470 --> 05:12.220
--I wonder if he made it to the ship.
--Sorry that I always listen to the same song.

05:12.350 --> 05:13.600
Zoro is alive.

05:13.640 --> 05:17.350
I'm sure he's getting stronger
somewhere in the world.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.810
Onihihi!

05:18.940 --> 05:20.520
--What did you say?
--Onigiri.

05:20.650 --> 05:22.480
--No way!
--You making fun of him?

05:22.610 --> 05:25.860
--Why does he put a sword in his mouth?
--More is not always better!

05:25.990 --> 05:27.360
--Oss.
--What?

05:27.490 --> 05:28.950
--Moss.
--Why?

05:29.070 --> 05:30.990
Mosshead!

05:34.870 --> 05:36.870
What's he so mad about?

05:37.330 --> 05:39.500
That's not just any card.

05:39.540 --> 05:42.710
That's the important key
to the future of Sabaody's security.

05:42.750 --> 05:45.920
Deliver it promptly. Treat it with care.

05:46.050 --> 05:47.880
What happens if I drop it somewhere?

05:49.510 --> 05:50.760
I won't drop it!

05:52.390 --> 05:53.930
That guy's scary.

05:54.060 --> 05:56.140
How could you crack a joke at him?!

05:56.270 --> 06:01.900
He alone held back a big ice block that could've
crushed our warship in the Paramount War.

06:02.020 --> 06:06.900
He is indeed the Benevolent King of the Waves
who has a steadfast spirit!

06:09.160 --> 06:10.530
<i>How cute!</i>

06:11.070 --> 06:14.120
<i>Oh no! He's so cute, I'm taken by surprise
every time I see him.</i>

06:14.160 --> 06:17.830
<i>But Chopper-</i>kun<i> is a pirate
and I'm a Navy soldier.</i>

06:17.870 --> 06:19.420
<i>We're like oil and water.</i>

06:19.540 --> 06:23.210
--<i>But I can't crack down on you!</i>
--Ring, ring, ring...

06:23.250 --> 06:24.630
--Clank.
--Hello.

06:24.750 --> 06:28.720
<i>What happened to the activation passkey
for the new anti-pirate weapon?</i>

06:28.840 --> 06:30.890
Yes, I sent a man a moment ago.

06:31.010 --> 06:35.890
<i>If this experiment is successful,
we can eradicate pirates from Sabaody!</i>

06:35.930 --> 06:37.390
<i>I'm counting on you.</i>

06:37.520 --> 06:38.560
Clank.

06:39.270 --> 06:41.440
<i>Oh, Chopper-</i>kun<i>...</i>

06:41.480 --> 06:43.440
<i>Where are you now?</i>

06:44.360 --> 06:45.650
<i>What's this creature?</i>

06:45.690 --> 06:48.110
"Special issue on Franky"?! Wow!

06:48.240 --> 06:51.110
--<i>Oh, so that robot is quite famous.</i>
--"Anatomy of Franky"?!

06:51.240 --> 06:52.660
Is he okay?!

06:52.700 --> 06:54.700
I'm scared!

06:57.700 --> 06:58.870
And he's not buying it.

06:59.000 --> 07:01.330
You left the key in the back door!

07:02.130 --> 07:03.630
And the other day...

07:06.300 --> 07:08.880
I was depressed for half an hour!

07:08.920 --> 07:11.590
If I can't make it in time,
I'll go crazy...

07:11.640 --> 07:13.220
I'm sor... Ugh!

07:13.260 --> 07:14.760
<i>The younger brother
from the greengrocer!</i>

07:17.560 --> 07:21.060
Phew! I know he would annoy me...

07:21.100 --> 07:22.060
Oh, no!

07:22.190 --> 07:25.020
I didn't drop anything!

07:25.150 --> 07:26.480
That's my...

07:29.030 --> 07:31.280
Ouch!

07:31.400 --> 07:34.620
The ground around here
is pretty uncomfortable to step on.

07:34.740 --> 07:35.910
You...

07:44.540 --> 07:45.340
They're in my way.

07:49.880 --> 07:53.640
A worthless roadside pebble
belongs in shadows.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.400
Hey, is this...

08:10.650 --> 08:13.070
Whoa-whoa, w-what's the matter?!
Are you hurt?

08:13.200 --> 08:16.120
No, I'm just having a rough day...

08:16.160 --> 08:19.660
Like, a Navy soldier took my letter, and...

08:19.790 --> 08:23.000
I just passed a soldier with a letter.

08:23.370 --> 08:24.710
He went in there.

08:29.880 --> 08:34.180
Okay, I'll teach you a special magic phrase.
Ready?

08:34.550 --> 08:37.180
"I'm waiting for someone,
so just water for now!"

08:37.300 --> 08:38.890
Just water for now!

08:39.010 --> 08:40.770
Get out, you brat!

08:40.890 --> 08:42.930
You damn amateur!
It's definitely Whitebeard!

08:43.060 --> 08:45.400
He's not a swordsman!
He was using a <i>naginata</i>!

08:45.520 --> 08:49.150
--It's Mihawk 'cause I saw his strength!
--Yeah, you saw Hawkeye. Okay.

08:49.270 --> 08:51.650
I saw it with my very eyes!

08:51.780 --> 08:54.900
You guys don't know anything!
The strongest is...

08:55.410 --> 08:56.160
...Akainu!

08:56.280 --> 08:58.280
We're talking about
the strongest swordsman!

08:58.410 --> 09:00.370
They're not good judges...

09:00.410 --> 09:03.580
Zoro is the most promising one,
so it's him. Right?

09:03.710 --> 09:06.670
How can you talk about Mosshead,
but not Black-Leg?

09:09.880 --> 09:12.300
--No way!
--His bounty is lower than Zoro's!

09:12.420 --> 09:14.920
There's no way
that he's the world's strongest!

09:18.800 --> 09:21.010
What's he so mad about?

09:22.310 --> 09:24.480
Calm down, guys. I see no end to this.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.770
--Let's narrow it down to young pirates.
--I got it back!

09:26.900 --> 09:28.190
Then, the Worst Generation?

09:28.650 --> 09:30.520
Trafalgar, Captain Kid...

09:30.650 --> 09:31.190
Zoro!

09:31.320 --> 09:32.860
--Oh, it's that one!
--And Straw Hat.

09:32.980 --> 09:35.320
I knew you'd be here!

09:37.240 --> 09:38.570
Big Bro!

09:38.950 --> 09:40.240
Why aren't you at work?

09:40.370 --> 09:43.330
The fate of that new weapon
depends on me.

09:43.450 --> 09:45.500
Stop it! That's confidential!

09:45.620 --> 09:48.830
Hey! Who do you think is the strongest?

09:48.960 --> 09:52.380
I know who his favorite is!
It's Straw Hat Luffy!

09:52.500 --> 09:54.880
Oh, why is that?!

09:55.010 --> 09:58.130
Are you guys supporting pirates?

09:58.800 --> 10:00.550
--No, no!
--That's not what this is about!

10:00.680 --> 10:03.600
Whoa-whoa.
He's kind of a wet blanket so...

10:03.640 --> 10:06.270
That's why you can't move up the ladder
like me.

10:06.390 --> 10:09.060
What? Is your little brother
at a higher rank than you?

10:09.190 --> 10:12.480
<i>He always says one word too many!
He's such a jerk!</i>

10:12.520 --> 10:15.990
<i>And as usual, the big brother
lets him say whatever he wants.</i>

10:16.030 --> 10:19.700
<i>Can you still love your little brother
when he's such a jerk?</i>

10:21.160 --> 10:24.040
<i>I don't like my brother.</i>

10:24.160 --> 10:26.000
He's so clumsy!

10:26.120 --> 10:26.870
How clumsy!

10:27.000 --> 10:27.750
How clumsy!

10:27.870 --> 10:28.620
How clumsy!

10:28.750 --> 10:31.250
Be smarter!

10:34.500 --> 10:35.380
<i>I...</i>

10:36.630 --> 10:38.470
<i>...don't like my brother.</i>

10:50.140 --> 10:52.520
W-What's this?

11:25.600 --> 11:27.720
Big Bro!

11:28.430 --> 11:31.350
Where are you, Big Bro?!

11:40.280 --> 11:43.110
Big Bro!

11:51.920 --> 11:54.630
I'm your brother!

11:55.960 --> 11:57.960
That sling slips off easily, doesn't it?

11:58.550 --> 12:00.880
The general issue ones suck!

12:01.380 --> 12:02.510
I don't want it.

12:02.630 --> 12:04.390
You got sloped shoulders, too.

12:05.470 --> 12:07.760
Be smarter!

12:10.270 --> 12:11.270
Big Bro...

12:12.730 --> 12:15.730
Run!

12:26.200 --> 12:30.450
<i>If Gold Roger hadn't triggered
the start of the Great Pirate Era...</i>

12:32.580 --> 12:35.040
<i>If Fire Fist Ace hadn't been caught...</i>

12:36.500 --> 12:39.460
<i>If we hadn't been called up to this war...</i>

12:43.300 --> 12:45.970
<i>If I hadn't been trapped
under the giant leg...</i>

12:48.140 --> 12:50.470
<i>If the sling hadn't broken...</i>

12:52.020 --> 12:54.230
<i>If I hadn't heard that guy's voice...</i>

12:56.230 --> 13:00.860
<i>Every little thing is
changing my life little by little.</i>

13:02.860 --> 13:04.740
<i>If I can survive...</i>

13:05.360 --> 13:09.990
<i>will I be able to make an impact
on someone's life someday?</i>

13:16.250 --> 13:18.000
<i>Just like that guy.</i>

13:22.170 --> 13:25.130
<i>My brother's here thanks to Straw Hat.</i>

13:25.470 --> 13:29.890
<i>But he lost his brother Ace
right before his eyes.</i>

13:30.350 --> 13:32.560
<i>He's been missing ever since.</i>

13:33.220 --> 13:35.520
<i>I wonder how he's doing now.</i>

13:36.270 --> 13:39.560
<i>This is urgent!
We found the Straw Hat Pirates!</i>

13:39.690 --> 13:40.860
Straw Hat?!

13:40.980 --> 13:44.740
<i>Seems like they're gonna meet
their new crew members at Grove 46!</i>

13:45.570 --> 13:46.610
So Nami...

13:47.490 --> 13:48.700
...will be there!

13:50.330 --> 13:53.540
Where's Nami?!

13:54.620 --> 13:58.250
A bunch of Navy soldiers suddenly rushed in
and started fighting pirates!

13:59.000 --> 14:01.090
They're obviously imposters!

14:01.130 --> 14:04.210
I mean, who is that?
Is she supposed to be Nami? Really?!

14:04.260 --> 14:08.300
Do your research!
If I were her, I would...

14:08.340 --> 14:10.720
What? What? No, no...

14:10.760 --> 14:12.260
Oh, no!

14:12.390 --> 14:14.850
Oh, damn!

14:14.890 --> 14:17.850
I couldn't get a ticket
to Soul King's final show of his tour...

14:17.980 --> 14:22.110
--Alright, let's browse as always!
--It doesn't cost anything to read!

14:26.860 --> 14:28.030
She's crying...

14:28.490 --> 14:30.620
You stupid barbarians!

14:32.160 --> 14:34.700
Pacifistas!

14:40.420 --> 14:41.790
Gum-Gum...

14:44.250 --> 14:45.800
...Jet...

14:47.300 --> 14:49.840
...Pistol!

14:51.840 --> 14:52.510
Oh...

14:53.100 --> 14:54.510
He's looking great.

14:58.890 --> 15:03.020
<i>Straw Hat Luffy beat
a Pacifista with a single blow?!</i>

15:03.060 --> 15:06.280
<i>That's great!
Lieutenant Commander, activate </i>it<i>.</i>

15:06.400 --> 15:11.990
But that weapon releases a toxic fluid into the sea
that dissolves ships along with their coating.

15:12.030 --> 15:13.990
It could affect the ecosystem...

15:14.120 --> 15:17.910
<i>Shut up! Do whatever it takes
to drown Straw Hat!</i>

15:18.040 --> 15:18.910
Clank.

15:19.790 --> 15:23.170
<i>Of all the ships,
it's the ship Chopper-</i>kun<i> is on...</i>

15:23.210 --> 15:25.000
<i>But I...</i>

15:25.040 --> 15:27.670
<i>I...</i>

15:27.800 --> 15:30.050
You can go see Soul King!

15:30.590 --> 15:33.550
--Soul King is Brook!
--They say he went to Grove 42!

15:33.680 --> 15:36.720
--He's a member of the Straw Hats!
--Straight from the venue!

15:36.850 --> 15:39.230
We'll take you there!

15:39.980 --> 15:41.230
No thanks!

15:41.350 --> 15:42.310
Don't be shy!

15:42.350 --> 15:45.650
Let us take you with us as a hostage...

15:48.730 --> 15:50.360
<i>Ugh! The older greengrocer brother!</i>

15:50.490 --> 15:53.360
--You're the girl from the wholesaler family!
--No, I'm not!

15:53.490 --> 15:55.910
Why are you here?! It's dangerous!

15:56.030 --> 15:59.580
Hey! We can't go on beyond this point!
Dark King Rayleigh is there!

15:59.700 --> 16:02.420
Rayleigh?! I didn't know he was alive!

16:02.790 --> 16:06.460
--Let's go around.
--It'll take 30 minutes to get to Grove 42.

16:08.130 --> 16:09.380
Let's make a deal.

16:09.420 --> 16:14.720
I can get there in 10 minutes.
You want to catch Straw Hat, right?

16:15.340 --> 16:17.350
I said, "let's make a deal"!

16:17.470 --> 16:21.100
How could I possibly allow
such a dangerous thing?! Let's go home!

16:21.230 --> 16:22.730
Don't treat me like a kid!

16:22.850 --> 16:25.020
I'm already 15!

16:25.150 --> 16:28.320
I told you! We're not pirates!

16:29.980 --> 16:32.450
What? Why did they run...

16:36.370 --> 16:39.620
--My Franky!
--My Zoro!

16:40.790 --> 16:44.000
I can't believe we really
made it through the square this quickly...

16:44.120 --> 16:47.130
--Isn't it amazing? So it's a deal!
--No, it's not!

16:47.250 --> 16:49.000
--Why not?!
--Let's go home...

16:58.100 --> 17:00.220
--What are those giant bugs?!
--Why are they attacking us?

17:00.350 --> 17:02.810
It's looking at you!
Did you do something to it?!

17:02.850 --> 17:05.980
Gee, I gotta go see Nami,
so stay out of my way!

17:06.100 --> 17:10.440
You can't go! It's our duty to
protect you civilians from dangerous pirates...

17:10.570 --> 17:12.360
Nami's not a dangerous pirate!

17:12.490 --> 17:13.990
But she's a pirate.

17:14.360 --> 17:16.280
Yes, she's a pirate!

17:16.410 --> 17:17.990
But she's different...

17:18.030 --> 17:21.080
She changed my life!

17:21.740 --> 17:25.750
I don't have a Devil Fruit power
or muscles like yours!

17:26.250 --> 17:30.380
I thought that in this age
where power is everything,

17:32.380 --> 17:35.880
a powerless girl like me
could never live freely!

17:38.010 --> 17:43.890
Nami is precious to me because
she makes me think I can have adventures, too.

17:44.020 --> 17:45.940
That's why I wanna support her.

17:46.060 --> 17:46.980
But...

17:50.150 --> 17:54.070
I can't let you see her in person, but
I'll allow you to see her from a distance.

17:54.190 --> 17:55.150
What?!

17:55.280 --> 17:57.530
I'll share the shortcut with the Navy.

17:57.950 --> 18:00.660
We'll do our best to arrest Straw Hat.

18:01.200 --> 18:04.410
But we're trapped in here.

18:06.830 --> 18:08.750
A key left in the lock...

18:09.290 --> 18:10.590
Is this a back door?!

18:11.840 --> 18:14.840
<i>This is the story of a hero</i>

18:15.420 --> 18:19.010
I'm on my way! I just got held back a bit...

18:19.140 --> 18:21.890
Hey!

18:22.350 --> 18:23.720
There is a giant bird in the sky!

18:23.850 --> 18:26.600
We have a visual of Monkey D. Luffy
on its back!

18:26.640 --> 18:29.600
The Straw Hats will reassemble!

18:30.060 --> 18:32.060
Thanks! I think I can make it in time!

18:32.190 --> 18:33.860
You can't see her in person!

18:35.940 --> 18:38.740
Hey, I think you've changed a little.

18:39.360 --> 18:41.740
Did something happen?
Is it because of the war?

18:41.870 --> 18:44.120
I guess it's because of the war.

18:44.580 --> 18:45.620
Thanks to this man...

18:49.750 --> 18:52.340
Thanks for carrying me this far!

18:52.460 --> 18:54.880
I'm sorry that
I move up the ladder so slowly...

19:07.600 --> 19:10.850
Boss, I caught an intruder.

19:10.980 --> 19:13.860
That's good.
Stay there and keep an eye on her.

19:13.980 --> 19:16.530
It's the perfect job for
a spoiled rich kid.

19:18.490 --> 19:20.150
Don't underestimate me...

19:20.200 --> 19:24.370
I'm the one who'll sink Straw Hat's ship
with the new weapon and make a name for himself.

19:24.490 --> 19:25.580
Sink?

19:25.620 --> 19:27.790
No! You can't do that!

19:31.460 --> 19:33.500
Nami... She'll die...

19:44.600 --> 19:47.890
A worthless roadside pebble
shouldn't have a say in anything.

20:01.070 --> 20:03.450
<i>I won't be able to see her in person...</i>

20:04.070 --> 20:07.490
<i>I'll just watch as their ship sinks...</i>

20:08.450 --> 20:13.000
<i>I can't even hand her a single letter...</i>

20:29.770 --> 20:32.350
--Civilians are attacking us!
--I'm gonna see Soul King!

20:32.480 --> 20:33.770
Let go of me!

20:42.280 --> 20:43.990
Th-The passkey!

20:44.320 --> 20:45.910
C-Catch her!

20:46.030 --> 20:49.540
Hurry up and take it back!
Or we won't be able to activate it in time!

20:49.660 --> 20:52.290
Fools! What are you doing?!
She's just a kid!

20:58.130 --> 21:01.170
B-Benevolent King of the Waves!

21:05.890 --> 21:09.430
<i>"Nami-</i>san<i>, you're my hope.</i>

21:10.970 --> 21:15.770
<i>In this world where power is everything,
even if I get hurt and trampled on,</i>

21:15.810 --> 21:20.690
<i>I still want to struggle, run,
and live as freely as I can.</i>

21:20.730 --> 21:24.450
<i>I came to think that way thanks to you.</i>

21:26.990 --> 21:32.620
<i>I hope you continue to have
wonderful adventures!"</i>

21:41.750 --> 21:45.970
Set sail!

22:04.490 --> 22:09.200
S-Straw Hat's ship
is out of the firing range...

22:11.580 --> 22:14.120
You brat! What the hell are you doing?!

22:14.250 --> 22:16.160
Whoa-whoa, kids don't know any better.

22:16.290 --> 22:17.620
Cut the crap!

22:17.750 --> 22:21.380
She stole and destroyed classified material.
This is definitely a crime!

22:21.750 --> 22:23.300
It could even be a felony...

22:23.420 --> 22:24.710
What are you talking about?

22:26.130 --> 22:29.510
This is my own letter.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.550
What?!

22:33.890 --> 22:37.520
I just retrieved my own letter
which was taken from me.

22:38.690 --> 22:40.270
It's to someone precious to me...

22:40.810 --> 22:42.310
It's a fan letter!

24:10.740 --> 24:14.660
Set sail!

24:16.830 --> 24:18.700
Yeah!

24:25.000 --> 24:28.210
We're back at Sabaody Archipelago
after two years!

24:28.340 --> 24:31.880
After two years...
What did each of us return here with?

24:32.010 --> 24:34.090
I get to see everyone again
at Sabaody Archipelago,

24:34.130 --> 24:35.390
a fateful place for us!

24:35.510 --> 24:40.970
I'll be watching over the Straw Hats
as they start anew!

24:41.100 --> 24:45.520
On the next episode of One Piece!
"The New Beginning! The Straw Hats Reunite!"

24:45.560 --> 24:50.530
I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
